  "limitations": [
    "The BS topology uses the already-frozen station-relative east_m/north_m columns; no runtime geodetic CRS transform is performed.",
    "Channel generation uses one four-user serving-sector chunk at a time with model.reset_topology(); cross-sector large-scale/spatial correlation across chunks is not claimed.",
    "The transmit polarization protection calculation is a conservative sum of the two orthogonal Sionna port-group spatial-mode powers, not an exact H-polarized far-field reconstruction.",
    "One channel/topology seed.",
    "Finite 19-site network without wraparound.",
    "8x8 dual-polarized pilot array rather than the frozen 16x16 sensitivity.",
    "Nine frequency samples are a pilot quadrature, not the final OFDM grid.",
    "Instantaneous proportional budgets are an oracle pilot; static/myopic/queue/CBF controllers are not compared.",
    "No mobility, uncertainty, calibration, multi-pass, or confidence interval evidence."
  ],
